BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:recWwQs4ysMGupMvj-single@turn-tigard
DTSTAMP:20260829T120558Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T203000
SUMMARY:Public Forum for Tigard City Council Candidates
DESCRIPTION:TURN will host candidates running for mayor and Tigard City Cou
 ncil to address the topics that matter\, from budget to public safety. Joi
 n us and find out what they support and ask candidates questions regarding
  what is important to YOU.\n\nInformation gathered from candidates after t
 he event will be posted on our website to help voters make an informed dec
 ision.
LOCATION:Senet Game Bar\, 12553 SW Main St #201\, Tigard\, OR 97223
END:VEVENT
